{"step_index":1510,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-05-15T20:49:06Z","content":"The \"invisible text\" bug struck one more time! \n\nMy logs showed `[Folders] Found 1 folders`, but the exact same issue was happening: Autodesk sends the folder name as `attributes.displayName`, and the dashboard was looking for just `name`. So it was drawing an empty, invisible box for the folder.\n\nI have just pushed the fix to the Folder Tree. It will now correctly extract and display the names for every folder.\n\n**Please refresh your browser.** The folder list will now be visible, and you should be able to click on it to fetch your Excel files and proceed with the sync."}
