{"step_index":1543,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-05-15T20:52:18Z","content":"My apologies, I missed a small structural change from the server consolidation. \n\nThe backend was sending your data wrapped in a nice package called `matches`, but the dashboard was trying to read it directly as if it wasn't wrapped, causing it to crash and throw the `res.data.map is not a function` error.\n\nI have updated the dashboard code to read the package correctly. Since this is a frontend fix, it has already hot-reloaded onto your screen. \n\n**No need to refresh.** Just click **Alignment** again and it will successfully parse the DWG mapping."}
